! app fails outright without it (found 2026-10-26).
||img.nvidiagrid.net^
||images.pluto.tv^
||canvas.tubitv.com^
||images.redbox.com^
||cdn77.utomik.com^
||blacknut-prod-images-cdn.b-cdn.net^
